  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">START Community-Led Innovation programme (CLIP), Gogrial West County, Warrap State</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through START Hub South Sudan, we will continue do a Community-Led Innovation Programme (CLIP) with women for change as main implementer in 2 Payams of Kuach North and Kuach South in Gogrial West County, Warrap State. Programme has been co-designed in meetings between CTP, Women for Change (WFC), and START Network (Backdonor ELHRA). The project shall be implemented as an extension of the previous project implemented in Kajo-Keji County in Payams of Kangapo 1 and Kangapo 2 respectively. The project shall follow the same phases of the project which shall include exploration, discovery, development, and growth/sustainability phase across the new location of Warrap State.</narrative>
  </description>
